==English==

===Etymology===
Respelling of ''[[bags]] [[I]]'', as used to claim an item, for example, ''Bags I have the last chocolate!''.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|bagsies|bagsying|bagsied}}

# {{lb|en|transitive|informal}} To make a verbal claim to.
#: ''I '''bagsy''' the top bunk of the bed.''

